3. **[role_user](file:///e:/NEW%20PROJECTS/ISELCO1STAR%20V2/iselco-backend/database/migrations/2025_12_22_123507_create_role_user_table.php)** (Pivot)
   - Many-to-many: Users ↔ Roles
   - Cascade deletes for cleanup
   - Prevents duplicate assignments

4. **[permission_role](file:///e:/NEW%20PROJECTS/ISELCO1STAR%20V2/iselco-backend/database/migrations/2025_12_22_123512_create_permission_role_table.php)** (Pivot)
   - Many-to-many: Roles ↔ Permissions
   - Cascade deletes for cleanup
   - Prevents duplicate grants

#### 👥 User & Department Tables

