   - Fields: `id`, `name`, `code`, `is_active`, `synced_at`
   - Tracks last sync timestamp

7. **[department_user](file:///e:/NEW%20PROJECTS/ISELCO1STAR%20V2/iselco-backend/database/migrations/2025_12_22_123850_create_department_user_table.php)** (Pivot)
