## ✅ Phase 4: API Development - IN PROGRESS

### Authentication API ✅

**Created** [AuthController.php](file:///e:/NEW%20PROJECTS/ISELCO1STAR%20V2/iselco-backend/app/Http/Controllers/Api/AuthController.php)

**Endpoints Implemented:**
- `POST /api/login` - Mobile number + password authentication
  - Returns Sanctum token for SPA/mobile app
  - Includes `must_change_password` flag
  - Updates `last_login_at` timestamp
  
- `POST /api/logout` - Revoke current access token
  
- `GET /api/me` - Current user with roles, permissions, departments
  - Eager loads relationships
  - Returns flattened permissions list
  
- `POST /api/change-password` - Password change with validation
  - Prevents using default password "1234"
  - Clears `must_change_password` flag
  - Validates current password
  
- `POST /api/forgot-password` - Ticket-based password reset
  - Creates password reset ticket for admin review
  - Validates user information

### Metadata API ✅

**Created** [MetadataController.php](file:///e:/NEW%20PROJECTS/ISELCO1STAR%20V2/iselco-backend/app/Http/Controllers/Api/MetadataController.php)

**Endpoints Implemented:**
- `GET /api/departments` - All active departments (synced from external API)
  
- `GET /api/categories?department_id=1` - Categories with department filtering
  - Returns global categories for all departments
  - Returns department-specific categories when filtered
  - Eager loads default priority
  
- `GET /api/priorities` - Priority levels ordered by severity

### Ticket Management API ✅

**Created** [TicketController.php](file:///e:/NEW%20PROJECTS/ISELCO1STAR%20V2/iselco-backend/app/Http/Controllers/Api/TicketController.php)

**11 Endpoints Implemented:**

**CRUD Operations:**
- `GET /api/tickets` - List with filters (status, department, assigned_to, search)
- `GET /api/tickets/{id}` - Detail with timeline, comments, attachments  
- `POST /api/tickets` - Create with auto-generated ticket number
- `PATCH /api/tickets/{id}` - Update details
- `DELETE /api/tickets/{id}` - Delete (soft delete)

**Lifecycle Methods:**
- `POST /api/tickets/{id}/accept` - Accept ticket (NEW → ASSIGNED)
- `POST /api/tickets/{id}/start` - Start work (ASSIGNED → IN_PROGRESS)
- `POST /api/tickets/{id}/resolve` - Mark resolved (IN_PROGRESS → RESOLVED)
- `POST /api/tickets/{id}/verify` - Close ticket (RESOLVED → CLOSED)
- `POST /api/tickets/{id}/reject` - Reject resolution (RESOLVED → REOPENED)
- `POST /api/tickets/{id}/reopen` - Reopen ticket (CLOSED → REOPENED)

**Features:**
- ✅ Auto-generates ticket numbers (TKT-YYYYMMDD-XXXX)
- ✅ Timeline tracking for all status changes
- ✅ Database transactions for data integrity
- ✅ Eager loading relationships (priority, category, department, users)

### User Management API ✅

**Created** [UserController.php](file:///e:/NEW%20PROJECTS/ISELCO1STAR%20V2/iselco-backend/app/Http/Controllers/Api/UserController.php)

**8 Endpoints Implemented:**

**CRUD Operations:**
- `GET /api/users` - List with filters (department, search, is_active)
- `GET /api/users/{id}` - Detail with roles, permissions, departments
- `POST /api/users` - Create with role assignment
- `PATCH /api/users/{id}` - Update details and roles
- `DELETE /api/users/{id}` - Soft delete (prevents self-deletion)

**Management Methods:**
- `POST /api/users/{id}/reset-password` - Reset to "1234"
- `PATCH /api/users/{id}/toggle-active` - Activate/deactivate account

**Features:**
- ✅ Department-scoped queries
- ✅ Role synchronization
- ✅ Password reset with must_change_password flag
- ✅ Self-deletion prevention

