**Updated** [api.php](file:///e:/NEW%20PROJECTS/ISELCO1STAR%20V2/iselco-backend/routes/api.php)

**8 Routes Registered:**
```
POST   /api/login                    (public)
POST   /api/forgot-password          (public)
POST   /api/logout                   (auth:sanctum)
GET    /api/me                       (auth:sanctum)
POST   /api/change-password          (auth:sanctum)
GET    /api/departments              (auth:sanctum)
GET    /api/categories               (auth:sanctum)
GET    /api/priorities               (auth:sanctum)
```

**Authentication Flow:**
1. Client calls `POST /api/login` with `mobile_number` and `password`
2. Server validates credentials and generates Sanctum token
3. Client stores token and includes in `Authorization: Bearer {token}` header
4. Protected routes verify token via `auth:sanctum` middleware

