### Chat System API ✅

**Created** [CommentController.php](file:///e:/NEW%20PROJECTS/ISELCO1STAR%20V2/iselco-backend/app/Http/Controllers/Api/CommentController.php)

**5 Endpoints Implemented:**
- `GET /api/tickets/{ticketId}/comments` - List comments with pagination
- `POST /api/tickets/{ticketId}/comments` - Post new comment
- `PATCH /api/comments/{id}` - Edit own comment
- `PATCH /api/comments/{id}/read` - Mark as read (read receipts)
- `DELETE /api/comments/{id}` - Delete comment (auth check)

**Features:**
- ✅ Real-time messenger-style chat
- ✅ Read receipts tracking (JSON array of user IDs)
- ✅ Internal comments flag (admin-only visibility)
- ✅ Edit/delete authorization (own comments only)
- ✅ Soft deletes support

### File Attachment API ✅

**Created** [AttachmentController.php](file:///e:/NEW%20PROJECTS/ISELCO1STAR%20V2/iselco-backend/app/Http/Controllers/Api/AttachmentController.php)

**3 Endpoints Implemented:**
