- `DELETE /api/attachments/{id}` - Delete file and record

**Features:**
- ✅ 25MB file size limit
- ✅ Polymorphic attachments (tickets, comments, timeline)
- ✅ Secure file storage (storage/app/public/attachments)
- ✅ Automatic file cleanup on deletion
